    {
      "id": 94253,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-28T18:38:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kingofsouls\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/58f4c7/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kingofsouls:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Qucik Question: If Tantrum, or any enviorment kill, destroyes the Moble Defence Platform Propulsion systems, is that reducing it to 0 HP? I want to say no but I am not sure.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You can only reduce HP by dealing damage. Being destroyed through a \"Destruction\" effect is not the same as being destroyed by dropping HP to 0 or fewer. Though they both end up being \"destroyed\", the alternate loss condition on PS would not trigger because of this.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:20:43.870Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 9753,
      "topic_slug": "does-destoy-mean-i-reduce-it-to-0-hp",
      "display_username": "Foote",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
