      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Kingofsouls\"]\n\nQucik Question: If Tantrum, or any enviorment kill, destroyes the Moble Defence Platform Propulsion systems, is that reducing it to 0 HP? I want to say no but I am not sure.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYou can only reduce HP by dealing damage. Being destroyed through a &quot;Destruction&quot; effect is not the same as being destroyed by dropping HP to 0 or fewer. Though they both end up being &quot;destroyed&quot;, the alternate loss condition on PS would not trigger because of this.\n",
