      "created_at": "2014-02-28T18:40:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No. &nbsp;I'm pretty sure it was worded the way it was because cards like Tantrum were making it too difficult to avoid instant death.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>ninja'd</p>",
