      "created_at": "2014-02-28T18:51:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The effect is also different since \"destroy\" effects can work around high DR and thus hurt targets that are otherwise well protected.&nbsp; Which gives cards like Tachyon's <em>Sucker Punch</em>, Ra's <em>Wrathful Gaze</em>, etc. their utility.</p>",
